    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"embracing the peace of being okay\" sounds so hollow. there's no peace in it, it just feels like a life sentence of being nothing. if you know you're never going to reach the top, why even bother staying in the race? it feels more like a punishment than a life.",
